    "title": "Woodburn pauses Flock Safety cameras amid community concerns over ICE involvement - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jennifer Singh, KATU ,\n1 hours ago WOODBURN, Ore. (KATU) — The city of Woodburn has suspended the use of the Flock Safety Camera System for at least 60 days. The decision came after Monday’s Woodburn City Council meeting when residents voiced concerns over how the camera system could potentially aid in federal Immigration and Customs Enforcement arrests. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
